OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for #35m wellness resort
OL,4,Afuels anxiety
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living in a cluster of rural
OL,7,Fvillages worry plans to create a #35m
OL,8,Fwellness retreat on the site of a
OL,9,Fformer quarry will harm their own
OL,10,Fwellbeing and transform their quiet
OL,11,Fcommunity.
OL,13,FLandowner Chris Griffin has applied for
OL,14,Fthe second time to transform Ashwicken
OL,15,FLake in west Norfolk, near King's Lynn,
OL,16,Finto a holiday destination with 154
OL,17,Flodges.
OL,19,FAt a public meeting on Monday, Richard
OL,20,FCoutts, the architect for the project,
OL,21,Fsaid it would create about 260 jobs.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
