OL,3,GNEWSAPlan for #35m wellness resort
OL,4,Afuels anxiety
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut villagers remain unconvinced and
OL,7,Fare particularly worried about hundreds
OL,8,Fof holidaymakers descending on the
OL,9,Fnarrow country roads to reach the site.
